WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.377 --> 00:00:01.911
moment.

00:00:02.044 --> 00:00:03.145
First I want to get you some of

00:00:03.279 --> 00:00:04.580
the other international stories

00:00:04.713 --> 00:00:06.148
that we are following here.

00:00:06.282 --> 00:00:09.818
And in Ukraine fire and sirens

00:00:09.952 --> 00:00:15.858
consumed the capitol's sky

00:00:15.991 --> 00:00:19.094
overnight.

00:00:19.094 --> 00:00:20.329
Debris rained down during a

00:00:20.462 --> 00:00:22.198
massive attack on Kyiv of a

00:00:22.331 --> 00:00:24.300
magnitude not seen in months.

00:00:24.433 --> 00:00:26.569
That's from a city military

00:00:26.702 --> 00:00:28.204
official who says two people

00:00:28.337 --> 00:00:29.205
were killed after several groups

00:00:29.338 --> 00:00:32.074
of drones approached from

00:00:32.208 --> 00:00:33.375
multiple directions.

00:00:33.509 --> 00:00:35.177
Meantime Russia was also hit.

00:00:35.611 --> 00:00:36.679
It saw the biggest drone attack

00:00:37.112 --> 00:00:39.548
on its territory since its full

00:00:39.682 --> 00:00:41.884
scale invasion of Ukraine began

00:00:42.017 --> 00:00:42.251
last year.

00:00:42.384 --> 00:00:43.719
Drones dropped various areas

00:00:43.852 --> 00:00:45.120
around the country and four

00:00:45.221 --> 00:00:47.590
military planes were damaged at

00:00:47.723 --> 00:00:49.558
an airport in western Russia.

00:00:49.692 --> 00:00:51.126
We are of course following all

00:00:51.126 --> 00:00:53.128
of this on the ground for you.

00:00:53.128 --> 00:00:56.398
As CNN's Melissa bell is live in

00:00:56.532 --> 00:00:57.132
zaporizhzhia.

00:00:57.132 --> 00:00:58.701
From your perspective, what are

00:00:59.134 --> 00:01:01.170
the key take a ways as we report

00:01:01.303 --> 00:01:05.140
this news, Melissa?

00:01:05.241 --> 00:01:07.843
&gt;&gt; Clearly that there was this

00:01:07.977 --> 00:01:09.144
huge night of missile strikes

00:01:09.144 --> 00:01:11.981
and drone strikes, as you said,

00:01:12.114 --> 00:01:13.415
the biggest here in Ukraine

00:01:13.549 --> 00:01:14.483
since the spring is significant,

00:01:14.617 --> 00:01:17.486
of course because of the deaths,

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:18.821
the damage in Kyiv.

00:01:19.154 --> 00:01:21.156
And you showed those images,

00:01:21.257 --> 00:01:22.758
really impressive images of

00:01:23.158 --> 00:01:24.393
Kyiv's night sky, something we

00:01:24.526 --> 00:01:26.528
hadn't seen in awhile.

00:01:26.662 --> 00:01:27.997
Still I think the important

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:29.698
thing to take away from it is

00:01:29.832 --> 00:01:31.333
how effective Ukraine's air

00:01:31.467 --> 00:01:32.534
defenses were.

00:01:32.668 --> 00:01:36.572
There were 28 missiles launched

00:01:36.705 --> 00:01:38.641
and 16 drones, all but one of

00:01:38.774 --> 00:01:40.309
the drones were intercepted and

00:01:40.442 --> 00:01:42.411
I think that is significant in

00:01:42.544 --> 00:01:43.946
showing how well they are

00:01:44.079 --> 00:01:44.346
functioning.

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:45.514
And perhaps the most interesting

00:01:45.648 --> 00:01:48.684
thing of what happened overnight

00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:51.186
was the drone attacks on Russian

00:01:51.287 --> 00:01:51.920
soil.

00:01:52.054 --> 00:01:53.355
As you said the biggest one

00:01:53.489 --> 00:01:55.190
since the start of the war and

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:56.558
extremely far from Ukraine's

00:01:56.692 --> 00:01:57.192
borders.

00:01:57.192 --> 00:01:58.560
Including that successful attack

00:01:58.694 --> 00:02:00.262
on the airfield up in the very

00:02:00.396 --> 00:02:02.698
west, northwest of the country,

00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:05.467
much closer to the es ton yal

00:02:05.601 --> 00:02:07.736
border than the Ukrainian.

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:08.370
Significant because of the

00:02:08.504 --> 00:02:11.206
target as far as the way-- as

00:02:11.206 --> 00:02:12.274
far away from Ukraine as it is

00:02:12.408 --> 00:02:13.809
but also because of the damage

00:02:13.942 --> 00:02:14.143
done.

00:02:14.276 --> 00:02:17.212
Russia's air defenses did manage

00:02:17.212 --> 00:02:18.647
to stop some of those drone

00:02:18.781 --> 00:02:19.214
attacks.

00:02:19.214 --> 00:02:19.982
Six regions in all were targeted

00:02:20.115 --> 00:02:21.216
but the ones that did get

00:02:21.216 --> 00:02:23.752
through managed to damages

00:02:23.886 --> 00:02:24.420
transporter planes that were

00:02:24.553 --> 00:02:26.021
parked at that airport in

00:02:26.155 --> 00:02:26.388
Scotland.

00:02:26.522 --> 00:02:28.590
The point is that these are the

00:02:28.724 --> 00:02:30.225
kinds of planes that are used to

00:02:30.359 --> 00:02:32.394
transport troop, equipment, to

00:02:32.528 --> 00:02:33.562
try and bring reinforcements to

00:02:33.696 --> 00:02:35.364
Russian troops here in Ukraine.

00:02:35.497 --> 00:02:37.566
So a very specific target in

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:39.234
terms of its distance and in

00:02:39.234 --> 00:02:39.835
terms of the nature of what was

00:02:39.968 --> 00:02:40.169
struck.

00:02:40.302 --> 00:02:42.271
This goes to the heart of

00:02:42.404 --> 00:02:43.272
Ukraine's strategy.

00:02:43.405 --> 00:02:45.441
Kyiv doesn't comment on these

00:02:45.574 --> 00:02:46.775
individual drone attacks on

00:02:46.909 --> 00:02:48.243
Russian soil but it has in the

00:02:48.377 --> 00:02:50.079
past eluded to its strategy and

00:02:50.212 --> 00:02:51.714
did so again today through the

00:02:51.847 --> 00:02:53.248
voice of a presidential advisory

00:02:53.315 --> 00:02:55.384
who spoke of the fact that the

00:02:55.517 --> 00:02:56.418
war was moving to Russian soil

00:02:56.552 --> 00:02:59.254
it is about bringing it to the

00:02:59.254 --> 00:02:59.722
Russian people as it had been

00:02:59.855 --> 00:03:01.523
brought to the Ukrainian but

00:03:01.657 --> 00:03:03.625
also of course about trying to

00:03:03.759 --> 00:03:05.294
target Kee infrastructure in

00:03:05.427 --> 00:03:08.330
Russia that might be helped as

00:03:08.464 --> 00:03:10.466
part of Russia's attempt to push

00:03:10.599 --> 00:03:13.268
back Ukraine's counteroffensive.

00:03:13.268 --> 00:03:14.603
I think it is significant that

00:03:14.737 --> 00:03:16.238
these drone attacks some managed

00:03:16.372 --> 00:03:17.973
to get through successfully and

00:03:18.107 --> 00:03:19.274
a blow to Moscow.

00:03:19.274 --> 00:03:20.743
What we heard from Russia's

00:03:20.876 --> 00:03:22.878
foreign ministry is that these

00:03:23.278 --> 00:03:23.879
attacks will not go unpunished.

00:03:24.012 --> 00:03:26.181
This will have rattled Moscow,

00:03:26.315 --> 00:03:27.649
some of the drones that were

00:03:27.783 --> 00:03:29.284
intercepted were heading to

00:03:29.418 --> 00:03:31.286
Moscow, again Becky thrksz is an

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.288
important part of Kyiv's

00:03:33.288 --> 00:03:33.922
strategy and it is interesting

00:03:34.056 --> 00:03:35.290
that it is doing it as

00:03:35.424 --> 00:03:36.625
successfully as it seems to be

00:03:36.759 --> 00:03:39.862
doing it for now, Becky.

